## In this lab, we are going to augment web01 by adding a web application firewall (WAF).

### WAN-to-DMZ traffic
  - set firewall ipv4 name WAN-to-DMZ rule 1 action accept
  - set firewall ipv4 name WAN-to-DMZ rule 1 state established
### DMZ-to-WAN
- We must add a temporary rule to the firewall in order to get internet access to our web server
   - set firewall ipv4 name DMZ-to-WAN rule 999 action accept
   - set firewall ipv4 name LAN-to-DMZ rule 999 source address 172.16.50.3

### Adding mod_security, the core rule set, and php to web01
  - sudo dnf install mod_security mod_security_crs php php-common php-opcache php-cli php-gd php-curl php-mysqlnd -y
  - now delete our previous firewall rule
      - delete firewall ipv4 name DMZ-to-WAN rule 999 action accept
      - delete firewall ipv4 name LAN-to-DMZ rule 999 source address 172.16.50.3

